══════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\nToT assessment prior to merge (per branch)\n- SchemaCoverage • FactConsistency • RetrievalError • Drift • Canonicality\n- AmbiguityRate • DecisionScore (consensus/vote input)\n\nDEPTH 0 (RESUME): 🧑\u200d💼 GENERAL ANALYST (finish CoT spine)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- GA resumes with merged ToT evidence injected as context.\n\nCoT (Slides 5–7)\n  5️⃣ Validate findings (with ToT input)\n  6️⃣ 🧑\u200d⚖️ Compare/merge all CoT + ToT results using the criteria above\n  7️⃣ 🏁 Finalize canonical mapping\n\nDEPTH 2: 👩\u200d⚖️ SENIOR MANAGER REVIEW (Reflexion)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- REFLEXION_ROUNDS = 2\n  - Round 1: critique → redlines\n  - Round 2: specialists revise → confirm fixes\n\nDEPTH 2: ⚖️ PARTNER POLL (Self-Consistency Vote)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- SC_K = 5, majority_required = true\n- 5 partners independently review distilled variants (3–6 slides each)\n- Consensus ≥ 3/5 PASS; dissent logged as risk note\n\nDEPTH 3: 🏆 CHOSEN PATH (Final Client Deck)\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n- Archetype confirmed • Fixes applied • Risks logged • PASS\n===============================================================================\n```')]),
